  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.7\n        - A stacked bottom sheet recedes the right parent again. When the next step was stacked on a sheet before that sheet had finished closing (a selection sheet’s Done that opens the following step), the closing sheet was taken out of the stack by a rebuild that REVERSED the stack: the step on screen dropped to the bottom, and every later step receded the wrong sheet and was drawn over a fully visible parent. The rebuild keeps the order now; recede/restore animations are no longer behind an app-wide concurrency guard and cancel the sheet’s running animation first; a closing child no longer restores a parent the next step already covers.\n        - G9SelectionSheet.ShowForResultAsync(..., minimumSelected): multi-select Done stays disabled until that many rows are selected, so a caller never has to refuse an empty answer and reopen the sheet.\n\n        Earlier versions: https://github.com/ImanKari/G9MAUIControls/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
